&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic Executive Director to lead the RHA Injectable HA (Hyaluronic Acid) Filler portfolio. This role will be responsible for driving strategic growth, leading the launch of new indications, and strengthening market presence for our innovative filler products within the medical aesthetics industry. The ideal candidate will bring a strong blend of scientific expertise, medical marketing experience, and leadership capabilities to develop and execute impactful brand strategies, navigate a competitive marketplace, and collaborate cross-functionally to support business objectives and product success.&lt;/p&gt;
