&lt;li&gt;Lead the planning and execution of product launches for new indications, ensuring seamless integration with branding, marketing, and commercial strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement training initiatives for sales and medical teams to support effective communication of product benefits, clinical data, and usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive medical marketing initiatives, including the creation of promotional materials, educational programs, and clinical support content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with key opinion leaders (KOLs), healthcare professionals, and industry experts to strengthen product advocacy and market credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
