&lt;li&gt;Oversee budget planning and resource allocation for the RHA portfolio to ensure efficient investment and maximize return on investment (ROI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze business and financial performance metrics to evaluate the effectiveness of marketing strategies, product initiatives, and overall portfolio success.&lt;/li&gt;
